---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Dashboard | NeuroFamilia">
  <div class="app-layout">
    <aside class="sidebar glass-card">
      <div class="sidebar-header">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
          <span class="logo-icon">🧠</span>
          <span class="logo-text">NeuroFamilia</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <a href="#dashboard" class="nav-item active">
          <span class="nav-icon">📊</span>
          <span>Dashboard</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#contenido" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📚</span>
          <span>Contenido</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#quizzes" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🧠</span>
          <span>Quizzes</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#progreso" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📈</span>
          <span>Progreso</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#comunidad" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">👥</span>
          <span>Comunidad</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#coaching" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🎓</span>
          <span>Coaching</span>
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <div class="user-info">
          <div class="user-avatar">M</div>
          <div class="user-details">
            <span class="user-name" id="user-name">Tu familia</span>
            <span class="user-plan">Plan Básico</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="logout-btn">Cerrar sesión</button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <h1>Buenos días, <span id="welcome-name">familia</span> 👋</h1>
          <p class="topbar-subtitle">¿Qué querés aprender hoy?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <div class="search-box">
            <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar contenido...">
          </div>
          <button class="notification-btn">
            <span>🔔</span>
            <span class="notification-badge">3</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="dashboard-content">
        <div class="welcome-card glass-card">
          <div class="welcome-text">
            <h2>Continuá donde lo dejaste</h2>
            <p>Completaste el 65% del módulo "Emociones en la primera infancia".</p>
            <a href="#contenido" class="btn btn-primary">Continuar aprendiendo →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="welcome-progress">
            <div class="progress-ring">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100">
                <circle class="progress-bg" cx="50" cy="50" r="45"></circle>
                <circle class="progress-fill" cx="50" cy="50" r="45" style="stroke-dasharray: 283; stroke-dashoffset: 99;"></circle>
              </svg>
              <span class="progress-text">65%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-row">
          <div class="stat-card glass-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">📚</div>
            <div class="stat-info">
              <span class="stat-value">12</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Artículos leídos</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card glass-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">🧠</div>
            <div class="stat-info">
              <span class="stat-value">5</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Quizzes completados</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card glass-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">🏆</div>
            <div class="stat-info">
              <span class="stat-value">8</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Insignias ganadas</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-card glass-card">
            <div class="stat-icon">⏱️</div>
            <div class="stat-info">
              <span class="stat-value">4.5h</span>
              <span class="stat-label">Tiempo de estudio</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-section">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Continuá aprendiendo</h2>
            <a href="#contenido" class="see-all">Ver todo →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="content-grid">
            <div class="content-card glass-card">
              <div class="content-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);">
                <span class="content-badge">Primera infancia</span>
              </div>
              <div class="content-body">
                <h3>Entendiendo las emociones del niño</h3>
                <p>Aprendé a identificar y validar las emociones de tu hijo de 0 a 6 años.</p>
                <div class="content-meta">
                  <span>📖 8 min</span>
                  <span>🧠 Quiz incluido</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="content-card glass-card">
              <div class="content-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);">
                <span class="content-badge">Etapa escolar</span>
              </div>
              <div class="content-body">
                <h3>Límites sanos y disciplina positiva</h3>
                <p>Estrategias para establecer límites sin generar conflicto.</p>
                <div class="content-meta">
                  <span>📖 10 min</span>
                  <span>🧠 Quiz incluido</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="content-card glass-card">
              <div class="content-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706);">
                <span class="content-badge">Adolescentes</span>
              </div>
              <div class="content-body">
                <h3>Comunicación con adolescentes</h3>
                <p>Cómo mantener el diálogo abierto durante la etapa más desafiante.</p>
                <div class="content-meta">
                  <span>📖 12 min</span>
                  <span>🧠 Quiz incluido</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bottom-row">
          <div class="upcoming-card glass-card">
            <h3>Próximas actividades</h3>
            <div class="activity-list">
              <div class="activity-item">
                <span class="activity-dot"></span>
                <div class="activity-info">
                  <span class="activity-title">Quiz: Estilos parentales</span>
                  <span class="activity-time">Hoy, 8:00 PM</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="activity-item">
                <span class="activity-dot warning"></span>
                <div class="activity-info">
                  <span class="activity-title">Sesión de coaching</span>
                  <span class="activity-time">Mañana, 10:00 AM</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="activity-item">
                <span class="activity-dot success"></span>
                <div class="activity-info">
                  <span class="activity-title">Webinar: Neurociencia del sueño</span>
                  <span class="activity-time">Jueves, 7:00 PM</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tips-card glass-card">
            <h3>Consejo del día</h3>
            <div class="tip-content">
              <span class="tip-icon">💡</span>
              <p>"La validación emocional no es consentir. Es enseñar a tu hijo que todas las emociones son aceptables, pero no todos los comportamientos."</p>
              <span class="tip-author">— Dr. Daniel Siegel</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  const savedProfile = localStorage.getItem('neurofamilia_profile');

  if (savedProfile) {
    try {
      const profile = JSON.parse(savedProfile);
      const firstName = String(profile.name ?? '').trim().split(' ')[0] || 'familia';
      const userName = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#user-name');
      const welcomeName = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#welcome-name');

      if (userName) userName.textContent = String(profile.name ?? 'Tu familia');
      if (welcomeName) welcomeName.textContent = firstName;
    } catch {
      localStorage.removeItem('neurofamilia_profile');
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .app-layout {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    width: 260px;
    height: 100vh;
    position: fixed;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-left: none;
    border-top: none;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .sidebar-nav {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .nav-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-item:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .nav-item.active {
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .nav-icon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .sidebar-footer {
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .user-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .user-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
  }

  .user-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .user-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .user-plan {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .logout-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .logout-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--danger);
    color: var(--danger);
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .main-content {
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 260px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .topbar h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .topbar-subtitle {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .topbar-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .search-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .search-box input {
    flex: 1;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .search-box input::placeholder {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .notification-btn {
    position: relative;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .notification-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    right: -4px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background: var(--danger);
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Dashboard Content */
  .dashboard-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .welcome-card {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15));
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
  }

  .welcome-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .welcome-text p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .progress-ring {
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .progress-ring svg {
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }

  .progress-bg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--glass-border);
    stroke-width: 8;
  }

  .progress-fill {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.5s;
  }

  .progress-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .stats-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .stat-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stat-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .stat-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .see-all {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .content-card {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .content-image {
    height: 140px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .content-badge {
    padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: white;
  }

  .content-body {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .content-body h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .content-body p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .bottom-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .upcoming-card,
  .tips-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .upcoming-card h3,
  .tips-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .activity-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .activity-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .activity-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .activity-dot.warning { background: var(--warning); }
  .activity-dot.success { background: var(--success); }

  .activity-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .activity-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .activity-time {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .tip-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .tip-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tip-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .tip-author {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .sidebar {
      width: 80px;
    }

    .sidebar-header .logo-text,
    .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon),
    .user-details,
    .logout-btn {
      display: none;
    }

    .nav-item {
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .user-info {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 80px;
    }

    .stats-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sidebar {
      display: none;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .topbar {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .topbar-right {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .search-box {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: auto;
    }

    .welcome-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .stats-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .bottom-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
